@preamble use("math/approx")
sin
Returns an approximation of the sine of x, where x is in radians.
The approximation strategy and physical numeric representation are implementation
details rather than part of the module contract.

sin(x)

sin(0)           # 0
sin(3.14159/2)   # approximately 1
===
cos
Returns an approximation of the cosine of x, where x is in radians.
The approximation strategy and physical numeric representation are implementation
details rather than part of the module contract.

cos(x)

cos(0)           # 1
cos(3.14159)     # approximately -1
===
sqrt
Returns an approximation of the square root of x. Negative inputs fault.
The approximation strategy and physical numeric representation are implementation
details rather than part of the module contract.

sqrt(x)

sqrt(4)     # 2
sqrt(2)     # approximately 1.414
